{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqpd82jw9j3","workspace":"D:\\zonoid","title":"Windows daemon respawn storm: ps hook bug and detached start workaround","summary":"INCIDENT 2026-06-22, root-caused and stabilized. On Windows the SessionStart hook hooks/start-daemon.js dedup guard hasDaemonProcess() runs the Unix command `ps -axo pid=,command=`; execFileSync throws on Windows so the catch returns false, meaning the hook ALWAYS believes no daemon exists. So every time the live daemon misses the hook's 300ms /ping (its event loop blocks while loading the 917-node / 5965-edge graph), a new session's hook spawns another `node daemon.js`, which cannot bind port 8787 and hangs. The headless-drain fleet amplifies it: each `claude -p` drain is a new session = a SessionStart = another spawn. This self-sustained to 280+ orphaned daemon.js plus 100+ `node -e` ORCH_SCHEDULED_TASK sleepers (~24GB RAM), pegging the real daemon into timeouts/503s. Fix applied: killed the orphan daemons; restarted ONE daemon with headless drains OFF (env ORCH_HEADLESS_DRAINS=0 keeps it light and ping-responsive so the hook stops spawning) and spawned it DETACHED via node child_process spawn detached:true/.unref() — a plain PowerShell Start-Process child gets reaped when the tool's process tree is torn down, which silently killed three earlier daemon attempts ~25s in. KEY GOTCHAS: (1) `.orch-off` is a GLOBAL kill switch — daemon.js:11 self-exits on it too (require.main===module guard), so it disables the daemon, not just the hook; renamed to .orch-off.disabled-by-claude. (2) A require()-wrapper can't run the daemon because server.listen is inside `if (require.main===module)` at daemon.js:2585. PROPER FIX: make hasDaemonProcess() Windows-portable (port check or tasklist) — branch fix/windows-portable-hooks likely covers this. Keep drains OFF until that lands AND the graph is compacted (the slow load is the vulnerable window). Current daemon PID is ad-hoc/manual (not hook-managed) and will not auto-restart on reboot.","category":null,"tags":[],"created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-22T15:23:36.812Z","vec":[-0.08245240896940231,0.03629763796925545,-0.0413401797413826,0.05891452357172966,0.06469784677028656,-0.03216863051056862,-0.005266777705401182,0.018909206613898277,0.0037182888481765985,0.09762269258499146,-0.04247302561998367,0.008886286988854408,-0.01713631860911846,-0.004723670426756144,0.013509171083569527,0.05125141143798828,0.06628332287073135,-0.038501378148794174,0.010484946891665459,-0.0005365837714634836,-0.0330161489546299,0.01116092037409544,0.02995476871728897,0.005147687625139952,-0.05360483005642891,-0.037165042012929916,-0.07187193632125854,-0.029343318194150925,-0.03427364304661751,0.0039662509225308895,-0.043597109615802765,0.017209619283676147,-0.13069134950637817,-0.027272498235106468,0.06186375766992569,0.1092204824090004,0.09983129799365997,0.021364087238907814,-0.16134420037269592,0.004157601855695248,0.13657960295677185,0.10356428474187851,-0.07780057191848755,-0.05489737540483475,-0.0001863727084128186,-0.02799930050969124,-0.11569037288427353,-0.06684627383947372,-0.05615193024277687,-0.043455570936203,0.0009955670684576035,0.020446278154850006,0.07180800288915634,0.0716460719704628,0.017897412180900574,0.016515204682946205,0.04639122262597084,0.0005942514981143177,0.02362964116036892,0.017779115587472916,-0.05576225742697716,-0.03825659304857254,-0.02050657384097576,-0.03478190675377846,0.05628129467368126,0.07644382119178772,-0.011165748350322247,-0.03800991177558899,0.023265421390533447,0.02208014763891697,-0.022177891805768013,0.02117435820400715,-0.0799935832619667,0.007833044975996017,-0.03216297924518585,0.0669097974896431,0.05749177187681198,0.01602752134203911,-0.04823969677090645,-0.12286071479320526,-0.0865507647395134,-0.0037468555383384228,-0.043537382036447525,-0.0018085308838635683,-0.026532288640737534,0.06724987179040909,-0.017878931015729904,-0.02847103960812092,0.06310092657804489,0.06146969273686409,-0.0576863661